   o: ["The force may still be reasonable, and the jury must decide whether it was reasonable in all the circumstances", "The force is automatically reasonable because this is a householder case", "The force is automatically unreasonable because it was disproportionate", "Self-defence fails, but the householder has a partial defence reducing the offence"],
