   o: ["Yes, because disrepair is a continuing breach, so it can serve a s.146 notice for the continuing disrepair", "No, because accepting rent waives the breach permanently", "No, because waiver by an agent binds the landlord for the rest of the term", "Yes, and it need not serve a s.146 notice because the breach was waived"],
